New: a menu, behind the three dots beside the door. It tells you which version is running, and gives you a button that opens this app in the watch's own Play Store. Until now the watch could tell you neither what it was running nor whether anything newer existed without going through your phone. It shows the running version next to the link because after tapping Update, what the watch actually installed is the question you come back to ask. Available whether or not you are signed in.
